0000 - GET INTO THE ENCLOSURE BY CLIMBING TO THE PLATFORM ON THE EAST DOOR
0001
0002 - THERE IS AN AMMUNITION BOX IN THE ENCLOSURE
0003
0004 - FREE THE SPY THAT IS IN PRISON AT THE NORTHERN PART OF THE COMPLEX
